{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels</strong>: Every run is different \u2013 experience fresh, thrilling missions with unpredictable challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unstoppable Zombie Hordes</strong>: Fight through waves of zombies, mastering your weapons and strategically using your character abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Characters with Unique Abilities</strong>: Choose from a variety of characters, each with their own powerful abilities that can make the difference between life and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weapon Variety</strong>: From shotguns and rifles to explosive weapons \u2013 develop diverse strategies to take on the hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Progression</strong>: Level up during each mission, improve your gear, and upgrade your passive abilities to better prepare for escalating threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline-Pumping Gameplay</strong>: With fast reflexes and strategic thinking, survive even the most dangerous situations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round in <strong>Endless Deaths</strong> is an exciting adventure where you\u2019ll face new challenges repeatedly. The rogue-like mechanics ensure that no two runs are the same, offering fresh opportunities to improve your survival skills with each playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Escape the Zombie Horde?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the endless onslaught and make it to the safe house, or will you become just another victim of <strong>Endless Deaths</strong>? Every mistake could be your last, but every victory brings you one step closer to your goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Deaths</strong> offers endless replayability, thrilling combat, and constant progression that will keep you returning for more. Step into the apocalypse \u2013 if you dare!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meta Upgrade 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 2 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 3 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 7 ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 8","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"},{"name":"Meta Upgrade 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3295020/adc4de8478d75b5ac61d4c2408e80c4fba0a15a1.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295020?t=1740139769","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3295020?t=1740139769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st